Subject: [PATCH 0806/3799] soh: rename func_80B9D0B0 ->
 ObjRoomtimer_WaitForClear

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the running state: clears the room and plays the success chime when the room is cleared in time, or voids the player out when the timer reaches zero. Kills the actor either way.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Roomtimer/z_obj_roomtimer.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
